[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0141","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0141.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0157","title":"NetBSD VAX ptrace 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"NetBSD 系统在 VAX 架构上的 ptrace 调试接口存在权限检查缺陷，本地攻击者可通过调试进程修改 PSL（处理器状态长字）寄存器内容，从而绕过系统权限限制获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 NetBSD 多版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。利用条件为拥有本地 shell 访问权限，无需额外认证。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0157"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:07Z","remediation":"升级 NetBSD 至 1.4.2 及以上版本（该版本修复了 ptrace(2) 允许调试进程修改 VAX PSL 的问题），或在无法升级时移除受影响用户的 ptrace 操作权限，限制可登录 VAX 主机的本地用户范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/992","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3707ef32edab409db4eb6f5766397ecef95f7e15/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0157.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0157","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0157.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0157.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-w7c5-7mg3-xjw5/GHSA-w7c5-7mg3-xjw5.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0157.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001144.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0141.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0135","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0135.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0151","title":"GNU make 符号链接漏洞","description":"GNU make 在处理从标准输入读取的 Makefile 时，会跟随符号链接（symlink）而非读取实际文件内容，本地攻击者可通过创建恶意的符号链接指向其他用户的 Makefile，诱使目标用户在受影响目录下运行 make 命令，从而以目标用户权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 GNU make 各版本，CVSS 评分 6.2，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0151"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:06Z","remediation":"升级 GNU make 至 3.79 及以上版本（3.78.1 及更早版本受影响），该版本已修复从 stdin 读取 Makefile 时错误跟随符号链接的问题。如无法立即升级，应避免在多用户共享目录中使用 `make -f-` 或类似从标准输入读取 Makefile 的方式，并确保 Makefile 所在目录的写入权限仅限受信任用户，以防止本地攻击者通过符号链接劫持 Makefile 执行任意命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/981","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6acfb9cecc7e37f5bf14164f693abec3417aeb06/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0151.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0151","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0151.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0151.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2p4f-5m6f-7653/GHSA-2p4f-5m6f-7653.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0151.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001143.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8de92ff9-6e53-4ada-8d6c-40f454e5e195.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/d49ed792663c6bbe758cf7f56c6f7fd7c4afcbb1/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0135.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0122","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0122.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0137","title":"CartIt 购物车应用隐藏表单字段信息篡改漏洞","description":"CartIt 购物车应用程序存在设计缺陷，远程攻击者可通过修改隐藏表单字段（hidden form fields）的值来篡改敏感交易信息，例如商品价格、数量或订单金额。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击者仅需构造特制 HTTP 请求即可实现低价购买或信息篡改，影响使用 CartIt 的在线购物系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0137"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:04Z","remediation":"在服务端对所有表单提交数据进行严格校验，购物车金额、数量等敏感数据应存储在服务器端会话中而非客户端隐藏表单字段。对所有客户端提交的价格/数量字段进行服务端重新计算和验证，确保与实际商品价格一致。如使用第三方购物车组件，应替换为支持服务端数据管理的方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0137","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0137.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8ac21ad6117514c2d2073c3d7d77e898bf2697d2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0137.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0137","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/c30129e429a112fe5adcfb17ae2ff1b4c379d385/2000/CVE-2000-0137.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0137.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0137.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88296/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/3e910c6d0fff2c3163dd69b92eb626a214df8855/2000.tsv","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0137.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0122.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0122.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0122.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0121","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0121.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0135","title":"Atretail 购物车应用隐藏表单字段敏感信息篡改漏洞","description":"@Retail 在线购物车应用程序存在安全设计缺陷，其商品表单中的价格、数量等敏感交易信息以 HTML 隐藏字段（hidden form fields）方式传递至服务端，而未在服务端进行有效的完整性校验。远程攻击者可通过拦截并篡改 HTTP 请求中的隐藏字段值（如将商品价格修改为任意金额），从而以极低价格完成订单，导致商家遭受经济损失。该漏洞影响 @Retail 购物车系统的多个版本，攻击条件简单，无需任何身份认证，仅需基本的网络通信能力即可实施。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0135"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:04Z","remediation":"@Retail 购物车应用存在隐藏表单字段可被篡改的问题，应立即在服务端对所有表单提交数据进行完整性校验，禁止信赖客户端提交的隐藏字段值（如商品价格、数量等敏感信息）。同时建议升级到已修复此问题的版本，或替换为仍受支持且经过安全审计的购物车系统。若无法升级，应通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）对请求中 hidden 类型字段进行强制校验规则拦截作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0135","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0135.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8ac21ad6117514c2d2073c3d7d77e898bf2697d2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0135.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0135","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/c30129e429a112fe5adcfb17ae2ff1b4c379d385/2000/CVE-2000-0135.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0135.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0135.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88332/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/76ed5b243a5ac75f8d2d512d1de509d415e3e7ba/2000.tsv","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/c30129e429a112fe5adcfb17ae2ff1b4c379d385/2000/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0121.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0121.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0120","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0120.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0134","title":"Check It Out 购物车隐藏表单域敏感信息修改漏洞","description":"Check It Out 购物车应用存在不安全隐藏表单字段漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可直接修改 HTML 表单中的隐藏字段值（如商品价格、数量等敏感购买信息），导致任意修改订单金额或欺诈交易。该漏洞影响 Check It Out 购物车系统，利用方式简单，仅需向目标服务器发送经篡改的 HTTP 请求即可实施攻击，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0134"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:04Z","remediation":"对订单金额、商品价格等敏感数据应在服务器端重新计算并校验，禁止信任来自隐藏表单字段的客户端输入。同时对所有提交数据进行完整性校验（如 HMAC 签名），防止中间人篡改。如厂商已停止维护，建议迁移至支持服务端验证的购物车系统（如 Magento、WooCommerce）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0134","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0134.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8ac21ad6117514c2d2073c3d7d77e898bf2697d2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0134.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f