Explorer 至 5.5 以上版本。如无法升级，可在邮件客户端中禁用 ActiveX 控件及脚本执行功能，或配置 Outlook Express 以纯文本方式阅读邮件（工具→选项→阅读→以纯文本阅读所有邮件），防止恶意 JavaScript 自动执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/962","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0105.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/47aadecb5d7f9b0723652503f764f5addc1275b9/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0105.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0105","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4dd512046a74ddd9ae16741caf0933056ffd666e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0105.json","https://github.com/xaitax/SploitScan/blob/938d5f69569a096cf728175efd0ca15f6fd92c6a/README.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0105.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0105.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001131.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0090.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0089","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0089.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0104","title":"Shoptron 购物车应用程序隐藏字段篡改漏洞","description":"Shoptron 购物车应用程序存在敏感信息修改漏洞，攻击者可通过拦截并修改 HTML 表单中的隐藏字段（hidden form fields），在未授权的情况下篡改订单金额、商品数量、用户身份等敏感购买信息。该漏洞源于服务端未对隐藏提交字段进行完整性校验，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，影响 Shoptron 购物车系统的数据完整性与交易安全。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0104"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-02-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:00Z","remediation":"将订单金额、商品价格等敏感字段从隐藏表单移至服务器端会话存储，所有价格合计须在服务端重新计算而非信任客户端提交值；对必须保留的隐藏字段实施 HMAC 签名或加密防篡改；部署 WAF 规则拦截异常的隐藏字段修改请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0104","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2000-0104"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0089.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0089.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0089.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0087","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0087.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0103","title":"SmartCart 购物车应用隐藏表单域远程信息修改漏洞","description":"SmartCart 购物车应用程序存在不安全设计漏洞，远程攻击者可通过修改网页表单中的隐藏字段（hidden form fields）来篡改敏感的购买信息（如商品价格、数量等），从而以低于实际价格的金额完成订单结算。该漏洞源于服务器端对客户端提交的数据缺乏充分的校验与过滤，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用。影响所有使用 SmartCart 的在线商店系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0103"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:00Z","remediation":"此漏洞因应用程序依赖客户端隐藏表单域传输敏感数据（如价格、数量）且未在服务端校验导致。修复方法：1) 立即升级 SmartCart 至最新版本或迁移至受支持的购物车系统；2) 所有交易数据必须在服务端会话中维护和校验，禁止信任客户端提交的价格、折扣等敏感字段；3) 对隐藏表单域提交的数据实施 HMAC 签名校验以防篡改。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0103","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/47aadecb5d7f9b0723652503f764f5addc1275b9/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0103.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0103","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/edba2e8a11daaad31ff57bea0f9419186eb54326/2000/CVE-2000-0103.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0103.md","https